+/**
+ * A child of a Row or Column given the `weight` modifier shares the room left over by its siblings: Glance has only the
+ * "default weight" (every weighted child gets an equal share), which is a width or height of `Dimension.Expand`. Without
+ * this the modifier is ignored and one `fillMaxSize` child takes the whole widget.
